*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 1008LS-102
* Inductance = 1uH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-1000MHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
